WHY THIS SPLIT

This is the same split Create itself uses: MIT for the code, All Rights Reserved for
the art. The reason is practical. Code that cannot be reused is dead weight; art that
is freely reusable ends up in a dozen renamed packs, attributed to nobody, and the
person who drew it has no way to say no. The textures here were made for this mod, and
they stay with it.


